sender alice basic
sender bob pro
sender cora bulk
recipient rx
recipient ny tz=-05:00
recipient tokyo tz=+09:00
set-for rx retry.max_attempts 1
set-for rx breaker.threshold 2
link rx fail 1
send x1 alice rx First try
advance 2s
send x2 bob rx prio=urgent Direct one
link rx fail 1
send x3 alice rx Third try
advance 2s
stats
